<div class="container">
    <h1>恶魔的挑战级数</h1>
    <p>接下来几页的恶魔速览：</p>

    <div class="two-col-layout">
        <!-- 左栏 -->
        <div class="col">
            <div class="cr-item"><span class="cr-label">CR2</span><span class="cr-name">怯魔</span>成群攻击的小恶魔。</div>
            <div class="cr-item"><span class="cr-label">CR2</span><span class="cr-name">夸塞魔</span>协助邪恶凡人的聪明小鬼。</div>
            <div class="cr-item"><span class="cr-label">CR6</span><span class="cr-name">巴创魔</span>高而瘦削的长牙刺客。</div>
            <div class="cr-item"><span class="cr-label">CR7</span><span class="cr-name">魅魔</span>具有多种风貌的诱人妖妇。</div>
            <div class="cr-item"><span class="cr-label">CR9</span><span class="cr-name">弗洛魔</span>似秃鹰的野蛮战士，喜好战斗。</div>
            <div class="cr-item"><span class="cr-label">CR10</span><span class="cr-name">狩魔蛛</span>蛛形的笨重生物，同时猎杀恶魔与凡人。</div>
        </div>

        <!-- 右栏 -->
        <div class="col">
            <div class="cr-item"><span class="cr-label">CR11</span><span class="cr-name">狂战魔</span>蛙形恶魔，散发令人丧失动作能力的臭气，以诱惑凡人堕落为目标。</div>
            <div class="cr-item"><span class="cr-label">CR11</span><span class="cr-name">猎魔蛛</span>恐怖的蛛形构装生物，拥有致命的眼射线。</div>
            <div class="cr-item"><span class="cr-label">CR13</span><span class="cr-name">迷诱魔</span>以权力诱惑凡人的高壮恶魔。</div>
            <div class="cr-item"><span class="cr-label">CR14</span><span class="cr-name">判魂魔</span>臃肿的猿形地狱判官，拥有致命的打击能力。</div>
            <div class="cr-item"><span class="cr-label">CR17</span><span class="cr-name">六臂蛇魔</span>六只手臂的蛇形恶魔皇后，深渊部队的将军。</div>
            <div class="cr-item"><span class="cr-label">CR20</span><span class="cr-name">巴洛魔</span>强力的火焰恶魔王，拥有斩首剑与可怕的类法术能力。</div>
        </div>
    </div>

